{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1784248651970,"sessionID":"ses_0927f0a94ffe0MNkUI1qsEQ6A5","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"skill","callID":"call_00_Spq8ah1lQQAam0SWE6Wc5499","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"name":"shot-planning"},"output":"<skill_content name=\"shot-planning\">\n# Skill: shot-planning\n\n# Shot Planning\n\n## Outputs\n`05-preproduction/shot-list.csv` and later `07-capture/camera-paths.csv`.\n\n## Method\nAssign stable shot IDs tied to beat/scene IDs. Record location, framing, movement, action, dialogue/VO, duration, method, assets, and status. Group by set state and technical setup without breaking story performance. Include handles, clean plates, inserts, transitions, ambience, and safety shots.\n\n## Acceptance\nEvery scripted visual is covered; every shot is feasible; no asset lacks provenance; recapture can be reconstructed from the log.\n\nBase directory for this skill: K:\\Minecraft Narrative Studio\\.agents\\skills\\shot-planning\nRelative paths in this skill (e.g., scripts/, reference/) are relative to this base directory.\nNote: file list is sampled.\n\n<skill_files>\n\n</skill_files>\n</skill_content>","metadata":{"name":"shot-planning","dir":"K:\\Minecraft Narrative Studio\\.agents\\skills\\shot-planning","truncated":false},"title":"Loaded skill: shot-planning","time":{"start":1784248651906,"end":1784248651948}},"id":"prt_f6d81d013001f9tkzntlQ5DyMa","sessionID":"ses_0927f0a94ffe0MNkUI1qsEQ6A5","messageID":"msg_f6d81c9ee001zHiF7gXAb67T5S"}}
