{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1784248653673,"sessionID":"ses_0927f0a94ffe0MNkUI1qsEQ6A5","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"skill","callID":"call_00_EvBTpyRo1R2mF4f22aeI3944","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"name":"capture-workflow"},"output":"<skill_content name=\"capture-workflow\">\n# Skill: capture-workflow\n\n# Capture Workflow\n\n## Outputs\nCapture, camera-path, and audio logs with stable filenames.\n\n## Rules\nPin the world/tool versions. Never overwrite selected takes. Record take, file, date, technical status, performance status, selection, and notes. Capture room tone/ambience, clean plates, handles, and a safety take for irreplaceable moments. Back up world and project state before destructive changes.\n\n## Stop\nDo not proceed to edit with unknown missing shots; list explicit pickup requirements.\n\nBase directory for this skill: K:\\Minecraft Narrative Studio\\.agents\\skills\\capture-workflow\nRelative paths in this skill (e.g., scripts/, reference/) are relative to this base directory.\nNote: file list is sampled.\n\n<skill_files>\n\n</skill_files>\n</skill_content>","metadata":{"name":"capture-workflow","dir":"K:\\Minecraft Narrative Studio\\.agents\\skills\\capture-workflow","truncated":false},"title":"Loaded skill: capture-workflow","time":{"start":1784248653619,"end":1784248653671}},"id":"prt_f6d81d6ca001fUG1uwnhh9d92J","sessionID":"ses_0927f0a94ffe0MNkUI1qsEQ6A5","messageID":"msg_f6d81d0b4001prYQfevxZzvlEn"}}
